---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
import portrait from '../assets/zack-jacket.jpg';
---
<Layout title="About Zack LaChappelle | Central Ohio REALTOR®" description="Meet Zack LaChappelle, a Red 1 Realty REALTOR serving Marysville, Union County, and Central Ohio.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container page-hero__grid">
      <div><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">About Me</p><h1>A local advocate for a very personal decision.</h1></div>
      <p>Real estate is a business built on details, but the reason behind every move is human. I make room for both.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="page-section page-section--white">
    <div class="container about-split">
      <div class="about-portrait reveal"><Image src={portrait} alt="Zack LaChappelle, REALTOR with Red 1 Realty" /></div>
      <div class="about-copy reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Approachable by nature. Prepared by practice.</p>
        <h2>Real estate guidance built around relationships.</h2>
        <p>As a local real estate professional serving Marysville, Union County, and communities throughout Central Ohio, I believe buying or selling a home should feel exciting—not overwhelming.</p>
        <p>My approach starts with understanding what matters most to you. That might mean buying a first home, finding more space for a growing family, relocating, investing, or preparing to sell. From there, I will build a strategy around your priorities and keep communication clear from the first conversation through closing.</p>
        <blockquote>”Clients deserve an agent who is accessible, responsive, prepared, and willing to do the work.”</blockquote>
        <p>Strong ties to the Marysville community have given me a grounded perspective on what makes Central Ohio a great place to call home. While working for you, I will bring a business-minded approach to every transaction while never losing sight of how personal a move can be.</p>
        <p>As a REALTOR® with Red 1 Realty, I have access to some of the industry's top resources, technology, and market information that is necessary to help clients make informed decisions about their real estate goals.</p>
        <div class="principles">
          <div class="principle"><h3>Honest</h3><p>Direct communication, including the things you may not expect to hear.</p></div>
          <div class="principle"><h3>Available</h3><p>Responsive support when questions or decisions cannot wait.</p></div>
          <div class="principle"><h3>Thorough</h3><p>Close attention to the details that protect your interests.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CTA title="Let’s make your next move feel manageable." text="Whether you are ready now or still sorting through the possibilities, I am happy to help you get oriented." />
</Layout>
